      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.provider_specific_bit_flags_require_the_running__a0000708",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Provider-specific bit flags require the running game's dispatch definitions. Arbitrary bitfield writes are unavailable here.",
