      "id": "desktop.gamesettingsview.requires_the_active_fsr_4_input_format_the_loade_22e5aac7",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "gamesettingsview",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Requires the active FSR 4 input format. The loader also derives Non-Linear from the explicit sRGB/PQ keys; this editor preserves that coupled legacy state.",
