      "id": "desktop.hubshell.install_copies_the_current_package_unfamiliar_fi_29534045",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "hubshell",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Install copies the current package. Unfamiliar files are handled individually. Uninstall removes recorded files, including edited files, and reverses an explicitly recorded ReShade rename when dxgi.dll is available.",
