    {
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saved_preset_request_the_installed_dlss_or_ray_r_f32e4653",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saved preset request. The installed DLSS or Ray Reconstruction DLL determines supported presets; Automatic retains existing default/global inheritance.",
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "DLSS"
      ],
      "line_breaks": true,
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
          "line": 546,
          "kind": "backend"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "저장된 사전 설정 요청입니다. 설치된 DLSS 또는 광선 재구성 DLL이 지원되는 사전 설정을 결정합니다. 자동은 기존 기본/전역 상속을 유지합니다.",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saved_request_only_zero_disables_the_override_ra_a66f0429",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saved request only. Zero disables the override. Ratios depend on the running game, graphics card and provider qualification.",
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "line_breaks": true,
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
          "line": 452,
          "kind": "backend"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "저장된 요청에만 해당됩니다. 0은 재정의를 비활성화합니다. 비율은 실행 중인 게임, 그래픽 카드 및 공급자 인증에 따라 다릅니다.",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saved_resource_state_override_runtime_support_de_2d44221b",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saved resource-state override. Runtime support depends on the active non-DLSS upscaler and graphics API.",
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "DLSS"
      ],
      "line_breaks": true,
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
          "line": 535,
          "kind": "backend"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "저장된 리소스 상태 재정의입니다. 런타임 지원은 활성화된 비 DLSS 업스케일러 및 그래픽스 API에 따라 다릅니다.",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
    {
      "id": "desktop.neurotic-hubsettings.saves_the_in_game_xefg_precheck_bypass_request_d_fdc00aff",
      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "neurotic-hubsettings",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Saves the in-game XeFG precheck bypass request. Do not use this to skip a motion-vector size warning for Unreal Engine games. Runtime compatibility is not established by this preference.",
      "context": "Current UI: tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "line_breaks": true,
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "tools/packaging/customer/support/NeuRotic-HubSettings.ps1",
          "line": 449,
          "kind": "backend"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "게임 내 XeFG 사전 확인 우회 요청을 저장합니다. Unreal Engine 게임의 모션 벡터 크기 경고를 건너뛰기 위해 이 옵션을 사용하지 마십시오. 이 환경 설정으로 런타임 호환성이 설정되지는 않습니다.",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
