      "surface": "desktop",
      "section": "saved-settings",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Manual override for games incompatible with OptiFG HUD fixes. Automatic keeps the existing game rules, including Dragon's Dogma 2. This does not enable frame generation.",
